## TODO — Customize for your brand

- [ ] Replace `public/og.png` — Open Graph image for social sharing (1200x630px recommended)
- [ ] Replace `public/logo.png` — Logo used in JSON-LD Organization schema (200x200px)
- [ ] Update `src/lib/data/site-config.ts` — Site name, description, URLs, social links
- [ ] Update `src/lib/data/personas.ts` — Replace PigeonPost personas with your own
- [ ] Update section content in `src/components/sections/` — Hero copy, features, testimonials, FAQ
- [ ] Add your blog articles in `contents/blog/` (MDX with title, summary, publishedAt frontmatter)
- [ ] Set `NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_FORM_URL` in `.env` to your form service endpoint, so the contact form sends messages
- [ ] Give the build your production URL before the first deploy, as [`docs/agents/cloudflare-deploy.md`](docs/agents/cloudflare-deploy.md) describes (it is baked into the sitemap and canonical URLs)
